(97, '<Name>, Champion of the Frozen Wastes', 'Champion of the Frozen Wastes', 'Defeat the dungeon and raid bosses listed below. Criteria: Sartharion the Onyx Guardian (10 or 25 player); Kel''Thuzad (10 or 25 player); Malygos (10 or 25 player); Heroic: Anub''arak; Heroic: Sjonnir the Ironshaper; Heroic: Keristrasza; Heroic: Herald Volazj; Heroic: Loken; Heroic: Ley-Guardian Eregos; Heroic: Ingvar the Plunderer; Heroic: King Ymiron; Heroic: Mal''Ganis; Heroic: The Prophet Tharon''ja; Heroic: Cyanigosa; Heroic: Gal''darah', 'Wrath of the Lich King', 'Both', 'Achievement', 0),
